HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra1119.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra1120.fits,spectra1121.fits, spectra1122.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1123.fits,spectra1124.fits, spectra1125.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1126.fits,spectra1127.fits, spectra1128.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1129.fits,spectra1130.fits, spectra1131.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1132.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 1.0153466066629433, 1.0373511859933184,1.0276676055487877,              HISTORY 0.8483792523816941, 0.8580184394492582,0.9628988596103146,              HISTORY 1.107685370755257, 1.0664607608972765,0.9210757303367239,               HISTORY 1.0292671839551113, 1.2665711654549834,0.9851104029166716,              HISTORY 0.8613060068607774, 0.9641686449168473.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             